This mod reuses code and looks from three mods:

1. token-weather-usage by Eric Cologni (https://github.com/augiefra/claude-mods),
   Copyright 2026 Eric Cologni, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
   (a copy is in LICENSE-APACHE-2.0). hooks/pills.ts and the pill row in
   hooks/band.tsx port its band: the icons, tints, limit gauge, weather icons,
   turn bars and hover cards. Changes: ported to TypeScript, cut to the context,
   5h, cache and agents pills, fed by this mod's own figures, German labels.
   hooks/look.ts (the pane) adapts its weather icons and tints too.
   token-weather-usage in turn adapts the weather icons from the Token Weather
   example in https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-playground, Copyright
   2026 Anthropic PBC, Apache License, Version 2.0.

2. session-band by johnnyvizz (https://github.com/JohnnyVizz/claude-kit),
   licensed under the MIT License. Taken over: the color palette and the thin
   rounded bars.

